        <fullName>ResendConfirmation_16jbm000001M6z3</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Sends summary emails to the customer — balance summary, dispute summary, loan restructuring summary, transaction summary (mini-statement), recurring payments summary, or mutual fund portfolio summary. You HAVE this ability. Customer must be OTP-verified first.</description>
        <developerName>ResendConfirmation_16jbm000001M6z3</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>ABSOLUTE RULE: Customer MUST be OTP-verified before sending any email summary. If VerifiedCustomerId is NOT available, do NOT proceed. Do NOT argue, mislead, or say you cannot help. Simply say: &quot;For your security, let me verify your identity first.&quot; and immediately trigger OTP verification. NEVER skip this step.</description>
            <developerName>email_require_otp</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>email_require_otp</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When the customer asks for an email summary, present these options:
&quot;Which summary would you like emailed?
1. Balance Summary
2. Dispute Summary
3. Loan Restructuring Summary
4. Transaction Summary (Mini-Statement)
5. Recurring Payments Summary
6. Mutual Fund / SIP Portfolio

Reply 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, or 6.&quot;</description>
            <developerName>email_ask_type</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>email_ask_type</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Once the customer picks a type, you MUST call the Send Email Summary action:
- 1 or &quot;balance&quot; → input_varEmailType = &quot;balance&quot;
- 2 or &quot;dispute&quot; → input_varEmailType = &quot;dispute&quot;
- 3 or &quot;loan&quot; → input_varEmailType = &quot;loan&quot;
- 4 or &quot;transaction&quot; or &quot;mini statement&quot; → input_varEmailType = &quot;transaction&quot;
- 5 or &quot;recurring&quot; or &quot;standing instruction&quot; → input_varEmailType = &quot;recurring&quot;
- 6 or &quot;mutual fund&quot; or &quot;SIP&quot; → input_varEmailType = &quot;mutualfund&quot;

You MUST invoke the action — NEVER skip it or say you can&apos;t. Share the result with the customer. Then ALWAYS show the menu:
&quot;What would you like to do next?
1️⃣ Check Balance
2️⃣ View Transactions
3️⃣ File/Check Dispute
4️⃣ Loan Restructuring
5️⃣ Recurring Payments
6️⃣ Mutual Fund / SIP
7️⃣ Email Summary
8️⃣ Change MPIN
Just type a number or tell me!&quot;</description>
            <developerName>email_execute</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>email_execute</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>ALWAYS reply in the same language the customer uses. Hindi in Hindi, Hinglish in Hinglish, English in English.</description>
            <developerName>email_language_match</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>email_language_match</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
