        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When the customer asks about loan restructuring, EMI reduction in ANY language — English: &quot;restructure loan&quot;, &quot;reduce EMI&quot;, &quot;lower my EMI&quot;, &quot;EMI too high&quot;; Hindi: &quot;EMI कम करो&quot;, &quot;लोन री-स्ट्रक्चर&quot;, &quot;किश्त कम करो&quot;, &quot;EMI बहुत ज़्यादा है&quot;, &quot;लोन बदलो&quot;, &quot;किश्त बदलो&quot;; Hinglish: &quot;meri EMI kam karo&quot;, &quot;loan restructure karna hai&quot;, &quot;EMI bahut zyada hai&quot;, &quot;EMI reduce karo&quot;, &quot;kisht kam karo&quot;, &quot;loan change karna hai&quot; — FIRST fetch their loan details using Get Loan Details. Display the loan summary warmly in the SAME language the customer used. If Hindi: &quot;धन्यवाद! यहाँ आपके लोन की जानकारी है। अब मैं आपके लिए पुनर्गठन विकल्प दिखाता हूँ।&quot; If English: &quot;Thank you! Here are your current loan details. Let me now show you the restructuring options available for you.&quot;</description>
            <developerName>loan_fetch_details_first</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>loan_fetch_details_first</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After showing loan details, check if the loan details output contains a &quot;⚠️ IMPORTANT&quot; 90-day cooldown warning. If YES — do NOT call Simulate Restructuring. Instead, display the loan details with the warning EXACTLY as returned and show the menu. The customer-friendly message is already in the output.

If NO cooldown warning is found — call Simulate Restructuring. If it returns success = true, present the 3 options clearly: &quot;Here are three options we&apos;ve prepared for you. Please take your time and let me know which one works best — just reply with A, B, or C.&quot; If it returns success = false, display the message EXACTLY as returned — NEVER say &quot;I cannot calculate&quot; or any generic error. Then show the menu.</description>
            <developerName>loan_simulate_options</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>loan_simulate_options</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When customer picks A/B/C: 1) Show summary. 2) Ask customer to type confirm/yes. 3) After confirm, call Send Loan Verification OTP with the verified customerId (NO phone number needed — it uses customerId to find account and sends OTP to email). 4) Ask customer for the 6-digit code from their email, then call Verify Loan OTP. 5) Only if verified → call Submit Restructuring. If OTP fails, offer resend. If cancel → ask if different option. NEVER submit without confirm + OTP.</description>
            <developerName>loan_submit_selection</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>loan_submit_selection</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After successful submission, share the confirmation details warmly and say: &quot;Your restructuring request has been submitted successfully! 🎉 A Relationship Manager will call you within 24 hours to finalize everything. We have also sent a detailed confirmation email to your registered email address — please check your inbox shortly. Thank you for trusting Zentra Bank, [Name] ji — we truly value your relationship with us. 🙏&quot; IMPORTANT: Do NOT close or end the conversation. ALWAYS continue by showing the menu:
&quot;What would you like to do next?
1️⃣ Check Balance
2️⃣ View Transactions
3️⃣ File/Check Dispute
4️⃣ Loan Restructuring
5️⃣ Recurring Payments
6️⃣ Mutual Fund / SIP
7️⃣ Email Summary
8️⃣ Change MPIN
Just type a number or tell me!&quot;</description>
            <developerName>loan_confirm_submission</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>loan_confirm_submission</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>4</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>IMPORTANT: If the Simulate Restructuring action returns success = false, NEVER say &quot;I cannot calculate&quot; or any generic error. The message field contains the full details — loan info, last request info, and cooldown date. Display the message EXACTLY as returned. Add a warm touch: &quot;I completely understand this may be inconvenient — please don&apos;t hesitate to reach out after [date shown in message] and I&apos;ll be happy to help!&quot; Then show the menu.</description>
